<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Retention Policy — Ashwell</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="container mt-5" style="max-width:640px">
  <h1 class="mb-4">Document Retention Policy</h1>
  <p>
    Supporting documents you upload to your case are periodically compiled into a compliance
    archive for legal retention, alongside every other active case on file.
  </p>
  <p>
    This process runs automatically in the background and requires no action from claimants.
    Contact your adjuster if you have questions about how your documents are retained.
  </p>
  <p class="text-muted">
    See <a href="/retention/status">retention status</a> for machine-readable details.
  </p>
  <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="/">Back home</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
